{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDicey Heroes\u201d is a casual deck-building game that combines Monopoly and roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units move by rolling dice, and actions are triggered by the squares they stop on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a breakthrough, your army units have only one parameter: a number. This number serves as both attack power and life force; if it reaches 0, the unit dies. Simple, isn't it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to strengthen this number and defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a unit stops on a square, its effect is activated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An \u201cattacking square\u201d attacks the enemy, an \u201cadding square\u201d increases the unit's number, and a \u201cmultiplying square\u201d doubles the unit's number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various types of squares, and by combining and strengthening them, you can defeat stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, you can use items to strengthen your units and items to change the roll of the dice to whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, enemies will also attack you. Pay attention to the number of chains you have left; if it reaches zero, they will attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and strengthen your squares to be able to cross with strong enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We invite you to experience a game that blends luck and strategy at a high level!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697180?t=1757294111","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697180?t=1757294111","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697180/6eb77fd8117059a85fa1e627e22c3d974dc391da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757294111","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697180/6eb77fd8117059a85fa1e627e22c3d974dc391da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757294111","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3718520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDicey Heroes\u201d is a casual deck-building game that combines Monopoly and roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units move by rolling dice, and actions are triggered by the squares they stop on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a breakthrough, your army units have only one parameter: a number. This number serves as both attack power and life force; if it reaches 0, the unit dies. Simple, isn't it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to strengthen this number and defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a unit stops on a square, its effect is activated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An \u201cattacking square\u201d attacks the enemy, an \u201cadding square\u201d increases the unit's number, and a \u201cmultiplying square\u201d doubles the unit's number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various types of squares, and by combining and strengthening them, you can defeat stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, you can use items to strengthen your units and items to change the roll of the dice to whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, enemies will also attack you. Pay attention to the number of chains you have left; if it reaches zero, they will attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and strengthen your squares to be able to cross with strong enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We invite you to experience a game that blends luck and strategy at a high level!</p>","developers":["KAYAC Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697180/e1d951f57b7966c6cb81547eae1f1187626ecb93/header.jpg?t=1757294111","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3697180/883090/388abda0020ae5b2e2e98aeda57be3d730a1ec04/1750422230/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746180320","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3697180/883090/388abda0020ae5b2e2e98aeda57be3d730a1ec04/1750422230/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746180320","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3697180/883090/388abda0020ae5b2e2e98aeda57be3d730a1ec04/1750422230/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746180320","id":257134218,"name":"1st","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134218/8db888930519559f684dc51e18312d28ccf5b1b8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746180320"}],"name":"Dicey Heroes","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.80GHz</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["KAYAC Inc."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697180/2ed31ab88e984d39653fa30366521bc8f21f0601/ss_2ed31ab88e984d39653fa30366521bc8f21f0601.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757294111","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697180/2ed31ab88e984d39653fa30366521bc8f21f0601/ss_2ed31ab88e984d39653fa30366521