b5212d12bff6b2cd4d88598896c1093496e90/ss_a32b5212d12bff6b2cd4d88598896c1093496e90.600x338.jpg?t=1757294111"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697180/cd8a3b50195886719ad6677c23696d5b6f405141/ss_cd8a3b50195886719ad6677c23696d5b6f405141.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757294111","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697180/cd8a3b50195886719ad6677c23696d5b6f405141/ss_cd8a3b50195886719ad6677c23696d5b6f405141.600x338.jpg?t=1757294111"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697180/919521777aaf89f0622973a29f90bc37ef4474e2/ss_919521777aaf89f0622973a29f90bc37ef4474e2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757294111","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697180/919521777aaf89f0622973a29f90bc37ef4474e2/ss_919521777aaf89f0622973a29f90bc37ef4474e2.600x338.jpg?t=1757294111"}],"short_description":"Dicey Heroes is a Monopoly-based roguelike deck-building casual game. Actions such as attack, reinforcement, and defense are determined according to the squares stopped by rolling dice. Units have only one parameter, a number. The objective of the game is to strengthen this number. Simple, isn't it?","steam_appid":3697180,"support_info":{"email":"steam-info@kayac.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}